OL,3,GNEWSASalon owners urge Budget VAT cut
OL,4,Aas staffing pressures grow
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter 22 years running a salon, Marcus
OL,7,FPerkins says he is increasingly worried
OL,8,Fabout the future of the hair and beauty
OL,9,Findustry.
OL,11,FRising costs are making it harder for
OL,12,Fbusinesses to employ staff and invest
OL,13,Fin apprenticeships, he says, while more
OL,14,Fsalons are turning to self-employed
OL,15,Fmodels to survive.
OL,17,F"Seeing salons close on the high street
OL,18,Fis very scary," he said. "I'm very
OL,19,Fscared myself. Luckily it hasn't
OL,20,Fhappened yet but who knows what the
OL,21,Ffuture holds?"
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
