OL,3,GNEWSASalon owners urge Budget VAT cut
OL,4,Aas staffing pressures grow
OL,5,
OL,6,FPerkins is among more than 2,000 salon
OL,7,Fowners who have signed an open letter
OL,8,Fcalling on the Chancellor John Healey
OL,9,Fto cut VAT on hair and beauty services
OL,10,Ffrom 20% to 10% in this week's Budget.
